r a zombie becomes involved with the girlfriend of one of his victims, their romance sets in motion a sequence of events that might transform the entire lifeless world.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9035,\"title\":\"Slither\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kW3YriFoOAQZ6AqZhBde770BI3n.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wd0bjZUmaa4doKwDnKn3ldXDha9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A small town is taken over by an alien plague, turning residents into zombies and all forms of mutant monsters.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":512196,\"title\":\"Happy Death Day 2U\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4tdnePOkOOzwuGPEOAHp8UA4vqx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bU1n7bkDviEqwfKFTbjQ8BFrqEN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Collegian Tree Gelbman wakes up in horror to learn that she's stuck in a parallel universe. Her boyfriend Carter is now with someone else, and her friends and fellow students seem to be completely different versions of themselves. When Tree discovers that Carter's roommate has been altering time, she finds herself once again the target of a masked killer. When the psychopath starts to go after her inner circle, Tree soon realizes that she must die over and over again to save everyone.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9890,\"title\":\"The Stepford Wives\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ygr0Wlmm1KmE16TUefNitIscVBG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rjUeBEhX3xZ5gN5RNcCwUDGHCqx.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"What does it take to become a Stepford wife, a woman perfect beyond belief? Ask the Stepford husbands, who've created this high-tech, terrifying little town.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUn